<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-10815] NullPointerException in InitNewCoordinatorFuture.init() leads to cluster hang</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-10815</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Possible scenario to reproduce:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;1. Force few consecutive exchange merges and finish.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;2. Trigger exchange.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;3. Shutdown coordinator node before sending/receiving full partitions message.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

